# Wick, the Whorled Mind: "Whenever Wick or another Rat you control enters, create a 1/1 black Snail creature token if you don't
# control a Snail. Otherwise, put a +1/+1 counter on a Snail you control." Wick enters with no Snail: a 1/1 black Snail. A Memnite
# (not a Rat) changes nothing. An Engine Rat then enters while Bot1 controls the Snail: it gets a +1/+1 counter (2/2), and no
# second Snail is made. On turn 3, "{U}{B}{R}, Sacrifice a Snail": Wick deals damage equal to the Snail's power as it last was (2) to
# Bot2 and Bot1 draws two cards (3 in hand with the turn-3 draw).

